*   **maint_usd_yr**: Mercedes maintenance is generally more expensive than average (Result 2, 26). Score: **-0.20**.
*   **repair_risk_score**: The W447 Vito is generally considered reliable, backed by a good warranty (Result 14, 26). Score: **0.50**.
*   **hp**: PRO trim is available with engines ranging from 102 hp (older 110 CDI) up to 190 hp (119 CDI) (Result 2, 16, 22). The 114 CDI (136 hp) and 116 CDI (163 hp) are common in PRO (Result 2, 16). Compared to a 200 hp average car, most PRO engines are below or around average. Score: **-0.20**.
*   **torque**: Torque figures are decent for diesel engines (e.g., 114 CDI has 330 Nm/243 lb-ft, 116 CDI has 380 Nm/280 lb-ft, 119 CDI has 440 Nm/325 lb-ft) (Result 16, 31). This is above the average passenger car. Score: **0.50**.
